1
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:11,030
Kassa! There's a match today. Don't
forget! We'll go together, like before.

2
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:16,060
Okay... who are you?

3
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:21,550
It's me... the one you always shout at
when the ball is kicked!

4
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:25,310
Are you a football fan?

5
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:31,170
Me? You were the football fan. I only
came along because of you.

6
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:39,670
This place... have we been here before?

7
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:44,410
Yes. With me. For fifty years.

8
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:48,130
Goal! Goal!

9
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:51,200
But who are you?

10
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:55,790
I'm your friend. And I'm by your side,
like always.

11
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:01,400
Who is this man?

12
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:03,130
It's you.

13
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:06,250
And this one?

14
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,100
It's me.

15
00:01:08,290 --> 00:01:10,580
He looks like a good friend.

16
00:01:10,930 --> 00:01:12,430
I still am.

17
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:17,490
Some memories fade. But dignity and love
do not.

18
00:01:17,490 --> 00:01:22,490
Dementia isn't just old age. Know the
signs. Get help early. Don't leave them.

19
00:01:22,490 --> 00:01:25,990
He may forget your name. Don't you
forget to stay by his side.
